OL,3,GNEWSAYoung voices need to be heard,
OL,4,Ayouth MP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA member of the youth parliament (MYP)
OL,7,Fhas joined calls for the scheme to be
OL,8,Fcontinued as it faces an uncertain
OL,9,Ffuture.
OL,11,FThe parliament has more than 300
OL,12,Felected members aged between 11 and 18,
OL,13,Fbut the government has not committed to
OL,14,Fsupporting the programme in its current
OL,15,Fform beyond March 2027.
OL,17,FRyan Parsons, an MYP from
OL,18,FNorthumberland, said young people's
OL,19,Fvoices "deserve to be heard", adding:
OL,20,F"We are the future and our voices do
OL,21,Fmatter."
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
